aring bones and may shift the balance between bone formation and resorption. DXA, QCT and HR-pQCT assess different aspects of bone; BMD alone does not describe all aspects of bone strength. Enter results from an actual report and note the scan method and anatomical site. This website cannot measure BMD.</div></div></details>
